              "text": "{\n  \"title\": \"HTML Tutorial for Beginners - Full Course\",\n  \"summary\": \"Learn HTML from scratch by building a complete two-page website featuring semantic structure, lists, tables, images, and forms. Finally, publish your website live on GitHub Pages.\",\n  \"chapters\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Introduction & Core Concept\",\n      \"start\": 0,\n      \"end\": 90\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Creating the First HTML Page\",\n      \"start\": 90,\n      \"end\": 344\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Formatting & Structuring Content\",\n      \"start\": 344,\n      \"end\": 645\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Navigation, Lists, Links & Images\",\n      \"start\": 645,\n      \"end\": 920\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"start\": 920,\n      \"end\": 1198\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Finalizing & Publishing Live\",\n      \"start\": 1198,\n      \"end\": 1446\n    }\n  ],\n  \"segments\": [\n    {\n      \"start\": 0,\n      \"end\": 41,\n      \"chapter\": \"Introduction & Core Concept\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter gives an overview of the two-page website built throughout this tutorial and explains what viewers will learn.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 41,\n      \"end\": 90,\n      \"chapter\": \"Introduction & Core Concept\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter explains the basic purpose of HTML as the building block and structure of a website using an analogy.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 90,\n      \"end\": 130,\n      \"chapter\": \"Creating the First HTML Page\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter introduces starting from scratch on the desktop without prior experience.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 130,\n      \"end\": 162,\n      \"chapter\": \"Creating the First HTML Page\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter creates a project folder 'html-project' and opens it in Visual Studio Code.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 162,\n      \"end\": 218,\n      \"chapter\": \"Creating the First HTML Page\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter creates an 'index.html' file inside VS Code and uses Emmet abbreviation ('!') to generate an HTML5 boilerplate structure.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>Document</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body></body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 218,\n      \"end\": 247,\n      \"chapter\": \"Creating the First HTML Page\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter updates the document title inside the head tag.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body></body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 247,\n      \"end\": 288,\n      \"chapter\": \"Creating the First HTML Page\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter installs the Live Server extension in Visual Studio Code and launches the local development server.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body></body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 288,\n      \"end\": 344,\n      \"chapter\": \"Creating the First HTML Page\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds an h1 heading and paragraph element to the body of index.html and views the live preview.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <h1>My First HTML Page</h1>\\n    <p>I'm learning how to build websites with HTML.</p>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 344,\n      \"end\": 403,\n      \"chapter\": \"Formatting & Structuring Content\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter explains HTML elements, block vs inline structure, and introduces headings.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 403,\n      \"end\": 432,\n      \"chapter\": \"Formatting & Structuring Content\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds an h2 section heading, a paragraph with a strong element, and a paragraph with an em element.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <h1>My First HTML Page</h1>\\n    <p>I'm learning how to build websites with HTML.</p>\\n\\n    <h2>About This Course</h2>\\n    <p>HTML gives <strong>structure</strong> to every web page.</p>\\n    <p>We will learn everything <em>step by step</em>.</p>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 432,\n      \"end\": 512,\n      \"chapter\": \"Formatting & Structuring Content\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds an HTML comment and a paragraph with line breaks (<br>) to separate topics on lines.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <h1>My First HTML Page</h1>\\n    <p>I'm learning how to build websites with HTML.</p>\\n\\n    <!-- Main course content -->\\n    <h2>About This Course</h2>\\n    <p>HTML gives <strong>structure</strong> to every web page.</p>\\n    <p>We will learn everything <em>step by step</em>.</p>\\n    <p>HTML<br />CSS<br />JavaScript</p>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 512,\n      \"end\": 585,\n      \"chapter\": \"Formatting & Structuring Content\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter wraps elements into semantic tags: <header>, <main>, <section>, and <footer>.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <header>\\n      <h1>My First HTML Page</h1>\\n      <p>I'm learning how to build websites with HTML.</p>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section>\\n        <!-- Main course content -->\\n        <h2>About This Course</h2>\\n        <p>HTML gives <strong>structure</strong> to every web page.</p>\\n        <p>We will learn everything <em>step by step</em>.</p>\\n        <p>HTML<br />CSS<br />JavaScript</p>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>Built while learning HTML.</p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 585,\n      \"end\": 645,\n      \"chapter\": \"Formatting & Structuring Content\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter installs and explains Prettier code formatter for automatic indenting.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <header>\\n      <h1>My First HTML Page</h1>\\n      <p>I'm learning how to build websites with HTML.</p>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section>\\n        <!-- Main course content -->\\n        <h2>About This Course</h2>\\n        <p>HTML gives <strong>structure</strong> to every web page.</p>\\n        <p>We will learn everything <em>step by step</em>.</p>\\n        <p>HTML<br />CSS<br />JavaScript</p>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>Built while learning HTML.</p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 645,\n      \"end\": 673,\n      \"chapter\": \"Navigation, Lists, Links & Images\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter introduces file paths, fragment links, unordered/ordered lists, and images.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 673,\n      \"end\": 733,\n      \"chapter\": \"Navigation, Lists, Links & Images\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds an id to section and creates a navigation link with anchor tag pointing to #about.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <header>\\n      <h1>My First HTML Page</h1>\\n      <p>I'm learning how to build websites with HTML.</p>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"#about\\\">About</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section id=\\\"about\\\">\\n        <!-- Main course content -->\\n        <h2>About This Course</h2>\\n        <p>HTML gives <strong>structure</strong> to every web page.</p>\\n        <p>We will learn everything <em>step by step</em>.</p>\\n        <p>HTML<br />CSS<br />JavaScript</p>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>Built while learning HTML.</p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 733,\n      \"end\": 785,\n      \"chapter\": \"Navigation, Lists, Links & Images\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds an unordered list (<ul>) and an ordered list (<ol>) inside a new section.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"        <section>\\n          <h2>Topics We Will Learn</h2>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>HTML</li>\\n            <li>CSS</li>\\n            <li>JavaScript</li>\\n          </ul>\\n\\n          <h3>My Learning Steps</h3>\\n          <ol>\\n            <li>Write the HTML</li>\\n            <li>Save the file</li>\\n            <li>Check the browser</li>\\n          </ol>\\n        </section>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 785,\n      \"end\": 818,\n      \"chapter\": \"Navigation, Lists, Links & Images\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds an external link using target=\\\"_blank\\\" and rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" pointing to MDN documentation.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"          <p>\\n            <a\\n              href=\\\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML\\\"\\n              target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n              rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n              >Read the MDN HTML guide</a\\n            >\\n          </p>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 818,\n      \"end\": 853,\n      \"chapter\": \"Navigation, Lists, Links & Images\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter creates a second HTML page named 'about.html' with basic boilerplate code, heading, and paragraph.\",\n      \"file\": \"about.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>About This Website</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <h1>About This Website</h1>\\n    <p>This website is built one practical HTML step at a time.</p>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 853,\n      \"end\": 920,\n      \"chapter\": \"Navigation, Lists, Links & Images\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds a link to 'about.html' inside index.html and embeds an external placeholder image in 'about.html' using an <img> tag.\",\n      \"file\": \"about.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>About This Website</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <h1>About This Website</h1>\\n    <p>This website is built one practical HTML step at a time.</p>\\n    <img\\n      src=\\\"https://placehold.co/800x450?text=Learning+HTML\\\"\\n      alt=\\\"A placeholder banner that says Learning HTML\\\"\\n      width=\\\"800\\\"\\n    />\\n  </body>\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 920,\n      \"end\": 945,\n      \"chapter\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter introduces HTML tables and forms.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 945,\n      \"end\": 1011,\n      \"chapter\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds a table structure with <caption>, <thead>, <tbody>, <tr>, <th>, and <td> elements to display technology roles.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"      <section>\\n        <h2>Technology Overview</h2>\\n        <table>\\n          <caption>\\n            Core web technologies\\n          </caption>\\n          <thead>\\n            <tr>\\n              <th scope=\\\"col\\\">Technology</th>\\n              <th scope=\\\"col\\\">Purpose</th>\\n            </tr>\\n          </thead>\\n          <tbody>\\n            <tr>\\n              <td>HTML</td>\\n              <td>Structures the content</td>\\n            </tr>\\n            <tr>\\n              <td>CSS</td>\\n              <td>Styles the page</td>\\n            </tr>\\n            <tr>\\n              <td>JavaScript</td>\\n              <td>Adds interactivity</td>\\n            </tr>\\n          </tbody>\\n        </table>\\n      </section>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1011,\n      \"end\": 1065,\n      \"chapter\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter creates a contact form using <form>, <label>, and <input type=\\\"text\\\"> for Name.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"      <section>\\n        <h2>Contact Me</h2>\\n        <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <p>\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Name:</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" required />\\n          </p>\\n        </form>\\n      </section>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1065,\n      \"end\": 1104,\n      \"chapter\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds an email field (<input type=\\\"email\\\">) to the form.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"          <p>\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email:</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required />\\n          </p>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1104,\n      \"end\": 1135,\n      \"chapter\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds a dropdown topic select menu (<select> and <option> tags).\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"          <p>\\n            <label for=\\\"topic\\\">Topic:</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"topic\\\" name=\\\"topic\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"\\\">Choose a topic</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"html\\\">HTML</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"website\\\">Website feedback</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </p>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1135,\n      \"end\": 1187,\n      \"chapter\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds a <textarea> for messages, a checkbox for website updates, and a submit <button>.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"          <p>\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message:</label><br />\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"5\\\" required></textarea>\\n          </p>\\n          <p>\\n            <input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"updates\\\" name=\\\"updates\\\" />\\n            <label for=\\\"updates\\\">Send me website updates</label>\\n          </p>\\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Send Message</button>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1187,\n      \"end\": 1198,\n      \"chapter\": \"Tables & Contact Form\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter tests form validation in the browser showing required field warnings and email format check.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"          <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Send Message</button>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1198,\n      \"end\": 1248,\n      \"chapter\": \"Finalizing & Publishing Live\",\n      \"action\": \"The presenter adds a meta description tag in the head and a contact fragment link in navigation.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <meta\\n      name=\\\"description\\\"\\n      content=\\\"A beginner HTML website with examples of text, links, lists, tables, and forms.\\\"\\n    />\\n    <title>My First HTML Page</title>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <header>\\n      <h1>My First HTML Page</h1>\\n      <p>I'm learning how to build websites with HTML.</p>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"#about\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"#contact\\\">Contact</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About Page</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1248,\n      \"end\